# Tests

This directory contains tests for the ESP32 Air Pen firmware.

Testing is intended to verify individual components and ensure reliable operation of the device.

## Testing Areas

- I2C communication with the MPU motion sensor.
- Gyroscope data acquisition.
- Gyroscope calibration.
- Sensor noise and filtering.
- Push-button input handling.
- Cursor movement calculations.

## Test Environment

- ESP32 DevKit
- MPU6050 / MPU6500
- PlatformIO
- Arduino Framework

## Running Tests

Run the following command from the project directory:

```bash
pio test
```

Tests requiring physical hardware must be performed with the ESP32 and motion sensor connected.

